{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.checkDeprecatedQuotedSyntax\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">checkDeprecatedQuotedSyntax</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">stx</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Check whether `stx`, which is part of a syntax quotation, is a deprecated syntax kind, and if so,\nemit a warning.\n\nSyntax produced by expanding macros in the quotation (synthetic source info) is not reported: it is\nnot part of the quotation, and elaborating the result of the quotation reports it as produced by\nthese macros.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.checkDeprecatedQuotedSyntax","kind":"def","line":141,"name":"Lean.Elab.checkDeprecatedQuotedSyntax","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.lean#L141-L158"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.checkDeprecatedSyntax\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">checkDeprecatedSyntax</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">stx</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">macroStack</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Util.html#Lean.Elab.MacroStack\">MacroStack</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Check whether `stx` is a deprecated syntax kind, and if so, emit a warning.\n\nIf `stx` was written by the user (its head token has `.original` source info), the warning is\nattributed to the syntax itself even inside a macro expansion: enclosing macros (e.g. the internal\n`namespace` expansion of `def Foo.bar ...`) merely passed the user's syntax through. Only\nmacro-generated syntax (synthetic source info, as produced by syntax quotations) is attributed to\nthe macro call site via `macroStack`. Replacement suggestions are only offered for syntax written by\nthe user.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.checkDeprecatedSyntax","kind":"def","line":103,"name":"Lean.Elab.checkDeprecatedSyntax","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.lean#L103-L139"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.isDeprecatedSyntax\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">isDeprecatedSyntax</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">env</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Environment</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">kind</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.SyntaxNodeKind\">SyntaxNodeKind</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether `kind` is marked by `deprecated_syntax`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.isDeprecatedSyntax","kind":"def","line":59,"name":"Lean.Elab.isDeprecatedSyntax","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.lean#L59-L61"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.deprecatedSyntaxReplacementExt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">deprecatedSyntaxReplacementExt</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/EnvExtension.html#Lean.SimplePersistentEnvExtension\">SimplePersistentEnvExtension</a> (<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.SyntaxNodeKind\">SyntaxNodeKind</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span>) <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Data/NameMap/Basic.html#Lean.NameMap\">NameMap</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Maps each deprecated syntax kind to the `Macro` declaration generated from the alternatives of the\nlatest `deprecated_syntax` command for that kind, if any.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.deprecatedSyntaxReplacementExt","kind":"opaque","line":48,"name":"Lean.Elab.deprecatedSyntaxReplacementExt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.lean#L48-L57"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.deprecatedSyntaxExt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">deprecatedSyntaxExt</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/EnvExtension.html#Lean.SimplePersistentEnvExtension\">SimplePersistentEnvExtension</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.SyntaxDeprecationEntry\">SyntaxDeprecationEntry</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Data/NameMap/Basic.html#Lean.NameMap\">NameMap</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.SyntaxDeprecationEntry\">SyntaxDeprecationEntry</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.deprecatedSyntaxExt","kind":"opaque","line":37,"name":"Lean.Elab.deprecatedSyntaxExt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.lean#L37-L42"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.SyntaxDeprecationEntry.since?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">SyntaxDeprecationEntry</span>.<span class=\"name\">since?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.SyntaxDeprecationEntry\">SyntaxDeprecationEntry</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Optional version or date at which the syntax was deprecated.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.SyntaxDeprecationEntry.since?","kind":"def","line":35,"name":"Lean.Elab.SyntaxDeprecationEntry.since?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/De